		(descr "TI TPS22916C DSBGA-4, YFP0004 (drawing 4223507/A): body 0.75-0.81 sq, 0.5 mm MAX height incl. balls. Land generated+verified from the datasheet example layout (SLVSDO5F p.25): 4x diam 0.23 NSMD on 0.4 mm pitch, mask opening +0.05/side. Pad-to-pad air gap 0.17 clears the board 0.152 floor. Ball map (top/marking view, Fig 5-1): B2 ON top-left, B1 GND top-right, A2 VIN bottom-left, A1 VOUT bottom-right.")
